  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepening Ghana&apos;s Energy Transition Through Policy Support and Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana&#x2019;s Energy Transition Framework outlines a strategic pathway to achieve net-zero emissions by 2070. The Africa Centre for Energy Policy (ACEP) seeks to provide strategic and targeted support to advance Ghana&#x2019;s energy transition agenda. The initiative will focus on Policy and Capacity Support which shall assist key government institutions in the effective operationalization of existing policies and ensuring that institutional frameworks are robust, actionable, and adaptable.</narrative>
  </description>
